{"id":"2467644590e93018","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-omega-spectrum.md","title":"Omega 算子的纤维测度与谱","display":"df-omega-spectrum — Omega 算子的纤维测度与谱","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-omega-spectrum","aliases":["43-df-omega-spectrum"],"display":"df-omega-spectrum — Omega 算子的纤维测度与谱","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Section 18.5, definitions following Lemma 18.5.2","source_printed_pages":"560","source_pdf_pages":"580","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-omega-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-omega-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-spectrum — Omega 算子的纤维测度与谱"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Section 18.5, definitions following Lemma 18.5.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"560"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"580"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span> 的 Borel 公平硬币概率测度，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in[0,1]\">\\(x\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_U(x)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in2^\\omega:\\Omega_U^A=x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_U(x)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in2^\\omega:\\Omega_U^A=x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_U(x)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega),\\qquad m_U(x)\\coloneqq\\mu(F_U(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_U(x)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega),\\qquad m_U(x)\\coloneqq\\mu(F_U(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}(\\Omega_U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in[0,1]:m_U(x)&gt;0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Spec}(\\Omega_U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in[0,1]:m_U(x)&gt;0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个严格超水平集 {A:Ω_U^A&gt;r} 是开集：超过 r 由有限个停机程序与有限 oracle 查询见证。故 Ω_U 下半连续，且 F_U(x)={A:Ω_U<sup>A≤x}∩⋂_{k∈N}{A:Ω_U</sup>A&gt;x−2^{−k}} 为 Borel 集。这样 m_U 的测度调用有实际良定义依据，使用圆柱原子的 Borel 测度即可。谱记录有正测度 oracle 原像的输出；值域记录非空原像，二者不同。固定机器参数 U 保留在纤维和测度函数中。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Section 18.5, definitions following Lemma 18.5.2，印刷页 560，PDF 页 580。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\mu$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$ 的 Borel 公平硬币概率测度，见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$x\\in[0,1]$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\mu$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$ 的 Borel 公平硬币概率测度，见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$x\\in[0,1]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"F_U(x)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in2^\\omega:\\Omega_U^A=x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_U(x)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega),\\qquad m_U(x)\\coloneqq\\mu(F_U(x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Spec}(\\Omega_U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in[0,1]:m_U(x)>0\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1897,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-468","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-spectrum]] — Omega 算子的纤维测度与谱"},{"id":"1c0193f30ac79f90","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$m_U,F_U,\\operatorname{Spec}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-spectrum]]；$\\operatorname{LeftComputable}$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]。"}],"outgoing":["0680931785133191","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}